[fixtures/concurrent/time-slicing/src/index.js] The debounced function created by lodash's debounce on line 78 should be cancelled in componentWillUnmount to prevent memory leaks. Lodash debounced functions have a cancel method that should be called during cleanup.

Add this to the componentWillUnmount method:
```javascript
this.debouncedHandleChange.cancel();
